notes.content:
Greetings, friends!

The game update took a bit longer to develop than we had planned due to the fact that some systems had to be completely redesigned, but we think that you will like many future changes and we would like to share with you some details of the development progress:

[list]
[*]Added effects on close bullet hits/explosions for the player;
[*]Improved AI, the enemy actively uses aviation and artillery, if he has it;
[*]Added airplanes (refueling, transport, combat);
[*]Added helicopters (assault and transport);
[*]Added new types of battalions (air force battalion, navy battalion);
[*]Added loading and unloading systems for battalions (paratroopers);
[*]Added ability to loot cities (without capturing them);
[*]Added "collateral damage" when capturing cities;
[*]Added new research to the Tactical Campaign;
[*]Added new faction "Arvik";
[*]Added new faction "Rekvik";
[*]Added new faction "Bearish";
[*]Added a new faction type to the game - "Island States";
[*]Added new faction "Whalen";
[*]Added new faction "West Anjou";
[*]Added new faction "East Anjou";
[*]Added new faction "Velyland";
[*]Added new faction "Akutan";
[*]Added new rebel factions;
[*]Added new tank "T-34-85";
[*]Added new tank "Leopard I";
[*]Added new tank "Leopard II";
[*]Added new modification of M113 with Vulcan;
[*]Added ability to crush enemy infantry (with any technique);
[*]Added new shells to the game;
[*]Added new music for tactical mode (by Wiktoria Zac);
[*]Added new MLRS "HIMARS";
[*]Added Toyota Hailux with DShK machine gun, modification with ZU-23, modification with Vulcan, civilian version;
[*]Added new artillery "2S23";
[*]Added new artillery "2S9";
[*]Added new vehicles "TYPHOON VDV";
[*]Improved support movement system for some MLRS;
[*]Improved sights for artillery (for easy shooting from the 1st person);
[*]Improved artillery (increased accuracy);
[*]Improved weapon reloading for armored vehicles;
[*]Added new desert biome for the southern islands;
[*]Added new locations to the game (more than 50 new locations for tactical battles);
[*]Added mechanics of summoning aircraft and artillery from the global map in tactical battles (using binoculars);
[*]Added some new sounds;
[*]Added Mosin rifle;
[*]Added Vahan assault rifle;
[*]Added Valmet M78P assault rifle;
[*]Added Sako RK95 assault rifle;
[*]Added Valmet M78 assault rifle;
[*]Added Type 64 assault rifle;
[*]Added SKS rifle (old version);
[*]Added M1903 Springfield rifle;
[*]Added Galil assault rifle;
[*]Added Spas-12 automatic shotgun;
[*]Added Vektor R4 assault rifle;
[*]Added new achievements;
[*]Added new commander truck (Kamaz);
[*]Added new GAZ-66 truck with different modifications;
[*]Added new MLRS BM-21V.

[*]Fixed getting achievements;
[*]Changed the balance of production adaptation, now some development is available at the start;
[*]Fixed physics bugs in vehicles and tanks;
[*]Fixed garrisons, now not only police units give stability bonus, but also regular army units (police still give higher stability bonus);
[*]Fixed the construction window in global campaign mode;
[*]Fixed "Attack" to F1 key - your troops now actively attack the enemy;
[*]Fixed armor research branches in global campaign mode;
[*]Fixed battalion supply, added ability to send cigarettes and alcohol to troops;
[*]Fixed display of sights in armored vehicles;
[*]Fixed critical errors when rearming garrisons.
[/list]
Next we will have to work on some systems, fix bugs and test everything thoroughly, and soon we will have information from closed testing, screenshots, videos explaining new mechanics and so on. Thank you for your anticipation!

